<title>UK: Banco del Suquia prices $75 mln three-year bond.</title>
<headline>Banco del Suquia prices $75 mln three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond announced earlier by lead manager BZW has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANCO DEL SUQUIA</p>
<p> AMT    $75 MLN	 COUPON     8.875     MATURITY    30.JUL.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.91     PAY DATE    30.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.75	REOFFER    99.91     SPREAD	+295 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX/CORDOBA</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A	   SALE LIMITS US/UK/AR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENG/ARG   HOME CTRY  ARGENTINA TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    25 BP     SELL CONC  50 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND THREE-YEAR U.S.T</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
